>131</sup>I-MIBG therapy with non-responders.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="eps" xlink:href="6604273f2"/></fig><fig id="fig3"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Kaplan&#x02013;Meier chart demonstrating patient survival from the date of diagnosis in symptomatic responders to <sup>131</sup>I-MIBG therapy compared with non-responders.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="eps" xlink:href="6604273f3"/></fig><table-wrap id="tbl1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Patient demographics</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Characteristic</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Total (&#x00025;)</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Number of patients receiving <sup>131</sup>I-MIBG</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">48 (100)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Female</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">27 (56.3)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Male</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">21 (43.8)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Mean age at time of diagnosis</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">57.6 (s.d. 10.9)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Mean age at time of first <sup>131</sup>I-MIBG</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">61.7 (s.d. 10.0)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Presenting symptoms</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Diarrhoea</td><td al